{"parse":{"title":"技能图鉴库/锤的就是你","pageid":5683,"revid":13368,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E9%94%A4%E7%9A%84%E5%B0%B1%E6%98%AF%E4%BD%A0&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E9%94%A4%E7%9A%84%E5%B0%B1%E6%98%AF%E4%BD%A0&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E9%94%A4%E7%9A%84%E5%B0%B1%E6%98%AF%E4%BD%A0&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93\" title=\"技能图鉴库\">技能图鉴库</a> &gt; <b>锤的就是你</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h2><span id=\".E9.94.A4.E7.9A.84.E5.B0.B1.E6.98.AF.E4.BD.A0\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"锤的就是你\"><b>锤的就是你</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF:%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"编辑章节：\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" style=\"max-width: 100%; overflow-x: auto; -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;\">\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"5\">技能详情\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"5\"><img alt=\"技能 锤的就是你.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/c/c6/rgn8y4b33r29qjtcxu5nfs9m4lze0jw.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E9%94%A4%E7%9A%84%E5%B0%B1%E6%98%AF%E4%BD%A0.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/c/c6/rgn8y4b33r29qjtcxu5nfs9m4lze0jw.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E9%94%A4%E7%9A%84%E5%B0%B1%E6%98%AF%E4%BD%A0.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/c/c6/rgn8y4b33r29qjtcxu5nfs9m4lze0jw.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />锤的就是你\n</th>\n<td class=\"text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;消耗：</b>3\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;技能类别：</b>职业技能\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;冷却：</b>2\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;攻击方式：</b>范围攻击、对单位\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程：</b>1-1\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程高低差：</b>↓2-↑2\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围：</b>0\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围高低差：</b>↓0-↑0\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:70%;\" colspan=\"3\">\n<p>（物理伤害）攻击指定目标，造成<font color=\"#ed7950\">40%</font>范围伤害，击退<font color=\"#ed7950\">4</font>格，对免疫击退的目标技能倍率额外提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">70%</font>；再进行追击，对目标十字范围<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>格内所有敌人，造成<font color=\"#ed7950\">75%</font>范围伤害，再驱散<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>个[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">增益</span>]。拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"严肃点！\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">严肃点！</font></span></span>]时，本技能所有技能倍率提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">10%</font>，且追击后施加[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"晕眩\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">晕眩</font></span></span>]，持续<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>回合。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><img alt=\"技能范围 1-1 0.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/7/75/i12b13xi6nu3o31dwphrlipg2xm3bxm.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_1-1_0.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/7/75/i12b13xi6nu3o31dwphrlipg2xm3bxm.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"90\" data-file-height=\"90\" />\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">可习得该技能的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门外</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:70px;height:70px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E9%BB%8E%E5%90%84\" title=\"角色图鉴库/黎各\"><img alt=\"头像 黎各.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/5/50/g7oyfmhkv95nz1i4nhnv75z7rgcz678.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"hero_head_name\" style=\"width:70px;\"><font color=\"#fff\">黎各</font></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门内</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n</div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\">关联内容\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: